{"title":"Nothing is Sacred","link":"https://donotresearch.substack.com/p/nothing-is-sacred","date":1789387407000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/a_n_d_y_k_i_n_g/\">Andy King</a> is an artist and writer based in Berlin.<br /><a href=\"https://andyki.ng/\">View the artist’s website</a>.</p><div><div><div><p>Do Not Research is a reader-supported publication. Each week, we highlight the work of a writer, artist, filmmaker, poster or creative:</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><div><hr /></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"970\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y9jo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1b795bb1-5e09-444d-bae2-38b35f932079_4000x2666.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>King of the Hill, 2024</figcaption></figure></div><p>Far-right movements are exploding. The vast digital underbelly that helped reshape public opinion and enabled the election of right-wing politicians remains woefully understudied. Donald Trump’s victory in 2016 was the outcome of a decade of coordinated online attacks, disinformation campaigns, and psyops. These digital armies deliberately targeted the political center, exploiting economic anxieties to radicalize and recruit.</p><p>I have spent many years immersed in these spaces. I have read their manifestos, studied their tactics — rage-baiting, shitposting, brigading — and intervened where possible, attempting to de-radicalize some of the youngest participants.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WaVr!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe72c49e0-1ac1-4a51-8335-55b8965af1d0_4000x2667.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Mountain of Dishes, 2025 (Homage to Jon Rafman)</figcaption></figure></div><p>This engagement as researcher and anti-fascist shapes my artistic practice. To build tools for de-radicalization, one must not only understand the architecture of extremism but also <em>feel </em>the disillusionment and anger that feeds it.</p><p>My current project, <em>Nothing is Sacred </em>(2025–on- going), consists of 26 photographs. The series depicts elaborate sets that explore themes of loneliness, agoraphobia, celibacy, and escapism. At its core lies a growing conviction I observe in the online communities I study: the real world is beyond repair, escape is the only refuge.</p><div></div><p>Mundane acts such as washing dishes and sitting alone in a cluttered bedroom, are transformed into surreal scenarios, reflecting how people dis- appear into fantasy as a way of coping with the overwhelming reality. The perspective I adopt is that of the <em>hikikomori </em>— the long-term shut-in who has not left their flat for years and lives online. Importantly, these works are not depictions of right- wing ideologues. Many of the people I study, such as <em>volcels </em>(voluntary celibates) are apolitical and identify as queer. Rather, the images reflect the broader social conditions — unemployment, isolation, future anxiety — that make radicalization possible. Despite the heavy themes, the photographs are humorous — allowing the work to reach across divides.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gTed!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7a34509a-67cc-4e64-9472-7963beeb795f_4000x2667.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Death of Chad, 2025</figcaption></figure></div><div><p>»I should have never watched anime because i know that all those amazing adventures and romances and moments will never happen to me«</p></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gNYS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb197544b-d52c-45ce-a100-7d8ad4b92679_4000x2667.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Until Death Do Us Part, 2025</figcaption></figure></div><p>From 2D love and fictosexuality to dating simulators and parasocial bonds, I encountered practices that may seem fringe but reveal much larger shifts in how people connect through screens. The appeal lies in safety and control — attachment without vulnerability, intimacy without proximity. These phenomena reveal the double edge of digital existence — at once a site of long- ing and of withdrawal, a place where the craving for human contact collides with the retreat into customized and controllable worlds.</p><div></div><p>The photographed sets are artificial even when they appear real, built from scratch in my studio, a crucial metaphor for the fabricated nature of virtual realities. Within them, I slip in references — easter eggs that resonate with the communities I study, while remaining emotionally legible to wider audiences.</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wo8E!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F696ea7fe-ff95-4f00-afeb-0ac0cb8a7740_3000x2250.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YKKR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd890d87f-616c-470a-b235-72678e6b48a0_3000x2250.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1023\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gop5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa253adfb-c81c-4839-b4d8-c65b5e6b8b4f_4000x2810.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><em><strong>Andy King </strong>(b. 1988) is a digital media artist whose satirical and political works focus on internet subcultures, loneliness and human relationships in the digital age. She explores the blurring of borders between truth and fiction, copy and original, private and public spaces.</em></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!q3u1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F263ce87f-43f4-43fe-b0e2-0326e421cf53_3000x2250.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div>","author":"Do Not Research","siteTitle":"Do Not Research","siteHash":"052a8cac7a17c42c6b8ffe8b969cafe7c4a7dd5f1829079ba7204d563c6bf726","entryHash":"9a1deeac372ad2950fa80ced27e2d3515bffec656cf61c8ddcae88b964d2124c","category":"Sites"}